@baseUrl = http://localhost:5194
@accessToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ingredientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### API process
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Database connection
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI (Development)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Ingredient catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients?page=1&pageSize=20

### Published recipes, search and sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes?q=soup&sort=newest&page=1&pageSize=20

### Multiple ingredient filters use repeated query parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes?ingredientIds={{ingredientId}}&sort=cookingTime

### Recipe details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/{{recipeId}}

### Personal recipe list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/recipes?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a draft (replace ingredientId with an existing catalog ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Vegetable soup",
  "description": "A simple vegetable soup.",
  "servings": 2,
  "prepMinutes": 5,
  "cookMinutes": 15,
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "status": "Draft",
  "ingredients": [
    { "ingredientId": "{{ingredientId}}", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "note": null, "position": 1 }
  ],
  "steps": [
    { "position": 1, "instruction": "Cook until tender.", "durationMinutes": 15 }
  ],
  "categoryIds": [],
  "tagIds": [],
  "images": []
}

### Public reviews (published recipe required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/{{recipeId}}/reviews?page=1&pageSize=20

### Ingredient recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?ingredientIds={{ingredientId}}&limit=10

### Admin users (Admin role required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ingredient details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients/{{ingredientId}}

### Đọc danh mục và tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories

### Đọc tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
